allowtransparency=\"true\"></iframe></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h3>If the embedded game is slow, try the following link:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://forbidden-realm.nlaha.com/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://forbidden-realm.nlaha.com/</a></h3>\r\n<p>We recommend using Firefox for best results!</p>\r\n<p><span></span></p>\r\n<h3>Description</h3>\r\n<p>Forbidden Realm is a colony sim where you play as a god whose followers are trespassing in the realm of an evil deity. Build up your settlement and guide your devotees through the disasters levied by the realm&#x27;s true owner. How long can you survive?<br></p>\r\n<p>Made by: Nathan Laha, Eli Bailey<br></p>\r\n<p>Assets used:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://govfx.itch.io/lightning-vfx-free-pack\">Lightning VFX Free Pack by GoVFX</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.fab.com/listings/a98fd943-5a62-4544-bcc7-5dbb5decc2e7\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.fab.com/listings/a98fd943-5a62-4544-bcc7-5dbb5decc2e7</a></li></ul>\r\n<p><strong>All other assets were made during the jam using Blender!</strong></p>\r\n<h3>Source Code</h3><p>Check out our GitHub repo!&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/nlaha/forbidden-realm\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">nlaha/forbidden-realm</a></p>\r\n<h3>Tips</h3>\r\n<p>You can click a person&#x27;s role in the table to change it. Usually, you&#x27;ll want one of each role.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>You can move the camera using the mouse, WASD, or the arrow keys. You can also zoom in and out with the scroll wheel.&nbsp;\r\n</p>\r\n<p>If you get yourself stuck, but don&#x27;t want to refresh the game, just click the &quot;clear storage&quot; button and all inventories will be emptied.\r\n</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" height=\"6\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_8863305\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Authors</td><td><a href=\"https://nlaha.itch.io\">Nathan Laha</a>, <a href=\"https://ecbai.itch.io\">ecbai</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-simulation\">Simulation</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-2d\">2D</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-colony-sim\">colony-sim</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-fantasy\">Fantasy</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-isometric\">Isometric</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div id=\"game_comments_1135694\" class=\"game_comments_widget base_widget\"><h2 id=\"comments\">Comments</h2><p class=\"form_placeholder\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fnlaha.itch.io%2Fforbidden-realm\" data-register_action=\"comment\">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p><div id=\"community_topic_posts_1730689\" class=\"community_topic_posts_widget base_widget\"><div id=\"community_post_list_7096686\" class=\"community_post_list_widget base_widget\"><div data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:5135590,&quot;id&quot;:11354428}\" class=\"community_post has_vote_column\" id=\"post-11354428\"><div id=\"first-post\" class=\"post_anchor\"></div><div id=\"last-post\" class=\"post_anchor\"></div>